cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Armillary or its data, please cite the paper."
type: software
title: "Armillary"
abstract: "Armillary makes a coordinate system for a set of stellar spectra from the spectra alone, and transfers labels from a few labelled stars to all the other stars through the same neighbour graph. This repository holds the package, a tutorial and the data products of the paper."
